# On hnguyen.dev, /portfolio-dashboard/* is served by a Workers Route pointing at
# the gated dashboard Worker, so Pages never sees those requests. This rule only
# takes effect on the *.pages.dev domain, where no Workers Route applies and the
# old static build's case-data.json was still being served from cache.
/portfolio-dashboard/* https://hnguyen.dev/portfolio-dashboard/ 302
